1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Hello everyone, in this video, we will introduce the new feature in the 2024 version of software model simulation.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The software model function will make the skin of the virtual model flexible.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
When wearing tight clothing, the skin surface will be squeezed, just like human skin.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
This function only works for Marvelous Designer VR default virtual model.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The function can also be used to automatically convert virtual models.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
After preparing your MD virtual model or virtual model after conversion, we will learn how to use software model simulation.

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Click on the virtual model, its properties will appear in the attribute editor window.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
When you select the software model simulation, an option for adjusting the strength of the software model will appear at the bottom.

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The smaller the strength of the software model, the softer the skin of the virtual model,

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,000
the more the skin is soft and the more the clothing is affected.

11
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,000
When selecting the software model simulation, a small icon will appear in the lower right corner of the 3D window,

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
reminding you that the software model simulation has been started.

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
When the simulation is started, you will see the skin sound bandage change.

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:25,000
When the simulation is started, you will see the skin sound bandage change.

15
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
You can't directly click and drag the virtual model skin to make it transform.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,000
The software model needs to act on it through clothing.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
When the software model simulation is started, the animation will be recorded.

18
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
The animation of the software model simulation will be recorded along with the clothing animation.

19
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:47,000
And the software simulation will record an animation layer independently.

20
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The animation of the software model can only be exported through the Alembic file format.

21
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,000
If you export it in other 3D formats, it will only export the current model.

22
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Now let's export the Alembic file.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
When exporting the Alembic file, be sure to select the virtual model.

24
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,000
When exporting the Alembic file, be sure to select the virtual model.

25
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,000
When exporting the Alembic file, be sure to select the virtual model.

